    ========

    >>> from sympy import sign, I

    >>> sign(-1)
    -1
    >>> sign(0)
    0
    >>> sign(-3*I)
    -I
    >>> sign(1 + I)
    sign(1 + I)
    >>> _.evalf()
    0.707106781186548 + 0.707106781186548*I

    Parameters
    ==========

    arg : Expr
        Real or imaginary expression.

    Returns
    =======

    expr : Expr
        Complex sign of expression.

    See Also
    ========

    Abs, conjugate
